---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Disclosure" description="How affiliate links work on kitchen.vijaya.io, plus a note on recipe and nutrition information.">
  <style>
    .back {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.4rem;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #fff3e4;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 0.44rem 0.92rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 231, 194, 0.45);
      background: rgba(14, 58, 52, 0.32);
      transition: all 0.24s ease;
    }

    .back:hover {
      background: rgba(14, 58, 52, 0.55);
    }

    .legal-sheet {
      background:
        linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0)),
        var(--paper);
      border: 1px solid var(--paper-edge);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      box-shadow: 0 18px 24px rgba(54, 25, 8, 0.25);
      padding: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.8rem);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .legal-sheet::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background:
        repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(52, 61, 40, 0.06), rgba(52, 61, 40, 0.06) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 5px);
      opacity: 0.18;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .legal-sheet > * { position: relative; z-index: 1; }

    .page-title {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.2rem);
      color: var(--ink);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .section-divider {
      width: 48px;
      height: 4px;
      background: var(--accent);
      border-radius: 2px;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .meta {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.74rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--ink-muted);
      margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
    }

    .legal-content {
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: var(--ink-soft);
      line-height: 1.65;
      max-width: 72ch;
    }

    .legal-content h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2vw, 1.3rem);
      color: var(--ink);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.03em;
      margin: 1.6rem 0 0.6rem;
    }

    .legal-content p {
      margin-bottom: 0.95rem;
    }

    .legal-content ul {
      padding-left: 1.2rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.95rem;
    }

    .legal-content li {
      margin-bottom: 0.45rem;
    }

    .legal-content a {
      color: var(--ink);
      font-weight: 600;
      border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--ink-muted);
      transition: color 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .legal-content a:hover {
      color: var(--accent);
      border-color: var(--accent);
    }

    .callout {
      background: rgba(20, 72, 66, 0.07);
      border: 1px dashed rgba(92, 79, 53, 0.35);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
      margin: 0.6rem 0 1.2rem;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--ink);
    }

    :global(html.dark) .legal-sheet {
      background: var(--paper);
      border-color: var(--paper-edge);
      box-shadow: 0 18px 24px var(--shadow);
    }

    :global(html.dark) .callout {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    }
  </style>

  <div style="margin-bottom:0.95rem;">
    <a class="back" href="/">← Recipes</a>
  </div>

  <article class="legal-sheet">
    <h1 class="page-title">Disclosure</h1>
    <div class="section-divider"></div>
    <p class="meta">Last updated: April 27, 2026</p>

    <div class="legal-content">
      <h2>Amazon affiliates</h2>
      <p class="callout">As an Amazon Associate, I earn from qualifying purchases.</p>
      <p>Some recipe pages on kitchen.vijaya.io contain affiliate links to products on Amazon (primarily amazon.in) — usually pantry ingredients, equipment, or kitchen tools I actually use. If you click one and buy something, Amazon pays me a small commission at no extra cost to you. The price you pay is identical to what you'd pay arriving at Amazon any other way.</p>
      <p>I'm a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.in.</p>

      <h2>Editorial integrity</h2>
      <p>I only link to things I'd happily recommend to a friend cooking in their own kitchen. Commissions don't influence which recipes I publish or which products I mention — if a tool isn't useful, it doesn't get a link, regardless of whether it would earn a commission.</p>

      <h2>Recipe and nutrition disclaimer</h2>
      <p>The recipes here are home-cooked dishes I've made and enjoyed. A few things to keep in mind:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Nutrition values are approximate.</strong> Calorie and protein figures (where listed) are rough estimates based on typical ingredients and serving sizes. They shouldn't be used for medical or strict dietary planning.</li>
        <li><strong>Allergens are your responsibility.</strong> Always check ingredient labels for allergens, especially when substituting brands or pre-mixed products.</li>
        <li><strong>Not medical advice.</strong> Tags like "healthy" or "lighter" reflect home-cooking intent, not clinical or therapeutic claims. Talk to a qualified professional for medical or dietary advice.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about a link or a recipe? Email <a href="mailto:vijaya2798@gmail.com">vijaya2798@gmail.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
